    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi>ρA</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br />Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
